                   \n                    <p>6-sol 可以用很久，但是很垃圾，很少用<br>现在基本 5.6 sol 高，5 小时可以用 30-60 分钟 跑满<br>6 astra 高，感觉 10-20 分钟就没了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18133663\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8fea/8dd3/162504_normal.png?m=1787038367\" alt=\"chunqiuyiyu\" data-uid=\"162504\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chunqiuyiyu\">chunqiuyiyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 15:33:45 +08:00\">16h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在 GPT 没法用了，额度少，还不说人话。可惜 claude 用不上。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18133697\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8597/43c7/808002_normal.png?m=1789114171\" alt=\"shuijingwanwqyy\" data-uid=\"808002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shuijingwanwqyy\">shuijingwanwqyy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 15:38:29 +08:00\">16h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我在自己的工作中，对比于 5.6 Sol 高 与 6 Sol 高，最终仍然选择了 5.6 Sol 高。因为执行耗时上，可能 6 Sol 高，会短大概 15% 左右。不过 6 Sol 高的执行质量上，也要差上 10% 左右了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18133712\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1789163514\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 15:41:03 +08:00\">16h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>6-astra<br>5.6-sol<br>5.6-luna max<br>不建议用辣鸡 6-sol 和 6-luna……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18133718\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1789163514\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 15:41:53 +08:00\">16h 28m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>性价比最高的其实是 astra low ，和 5.6-sol max 差不多水平，价格还不贵，暴打 6-sol max 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18133719\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b736d9e1973e7db28e67e0a30085d36e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"matianle\" data-uid=\"498862\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/matianle\">matianle</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 15:41:54 +08:00\">16h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>额度多时 6sol-high ，不够时 5.6luna-max</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18133767\">\n     